  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Ramón Laguarta (born 1963) is a Spanish businessman who is the chairman and chief executive officer of PepsiCo. He became CEO on 3 October 2018. He is the sixth CEO in the company's history and the first Spanish CEO of a large American multinational company.",
